  "readmeFile": "PackageReadme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.0 — P2 Cost Controls / Finance 100% completo (7/7 shipped). Nuevos componentes chart-tier: Waterfall (cascada Baseline → Approved CO → Pending → Current → EAC con SfChart + leyenda por kind), CashflowChart (barras Plan/Real/Forecast mensuales con ControlDate stripline — distinto a EvmCashflowCurve que es valor ganado), ContingencyDrawdown (curva consumo vs plan AACE 40R-08 con burn rate status badge), ManagementReserveTracker (saldo MR + step-line + tabla de eventos PMI Allocation/TransferTo/From Contingency/DirectUse/Release). 17 tests bUnit nuevos. Total solución: 781 → 798. Sin breaking changes.",
